OL,3,GNEWSACare home inadequate after 'sharp
OL,4,Adecline', CQC says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent care home has been rated
OL,7,Finadequate by the watchdog after
OL,8,Fstandards declined "sharply" from a
OL,9,Fprevious inspection, the Care Quality
OL,10,FCommission (CQC) said.
OL,12,FPilgrims Way Care Home with Nursing in
OL,13,FMaidstone had its rating downgraded
OL,14,Ffrom good to inadequate following an
OL,15,Finspection in August.
OL,17,FThe CQC placed the service into special
OL,18,Fmeasures, meaning it will be closely
OL,19,Fmonitored to ensure people are safe
OL,20,Fwhile improvements are made.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
