OL,3,GNEWSACare home inadequate after 'sharp
OL,4,Adecline', CQC says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the care home, run
OL,7,Fby Pilgrims Way Limited, said: "We
OL,8,Frecognise that improvements are
OL,9,Frequired, and our priority is to
OL,10,Fcontinue addressing these concerns
OL,11,Fconstructively and positively."
